#: ../../home/claude/work/docs_audit/docs_out/reference/python-api.md:1
msgid "Python API Reference"
msgstr "Python API 参考"

#: ../../home/claude/work/docs_audit/docs_out/reference/python-api.md:3
msgid ""
"Use pygeofetch as a library in your own scripts, notebooks, or applications."
msgstr "在你自己的脚本、笔记本或应用程序中将 pygeofetch 作为库来使用。"

#: ../../home/claude/work/docs_audit/docs_out/reference/python-api.md:6
msgid ""
"The main entry point is the `PyGeoFetch` class. Data models live in "
"`pygeofetch.models`."
msgstr "主要入口是 `PyGeoFetch` 类。数据模型位于 `pygeofetch.models`。"

#: ../../home/claude/work/docs_audit/docs_out/reference/python-api.md:13
msgid "Overview"
msgstr "概览"

#: ../../home/claude/work/docs_audit/docs_out/reference/python-api.md:15
msgid ""
"The Python API is organised around one object, the `PyGeoFetch` client, and "
"a small set of models. You describe a request with `SearchQuery`, call "
"`client.search()` to obtain a list of `SatelliteData` scenes, and pass those"
" scenes to `client.download()` or `client.stream()`. Download behaviour is "
"controlled with `DownloadOptions`, and each download returns a "
"`DownloadResult` that records the outcome. Processing capabilities are "
"exposed as namespaces on the same client, for example `client.indices`, "
"`client.preprocess`, `client.sar` and `client.post`, so that one import is "
"enough for most workflows."
msgstr ""
"Python API 围绕一个对象，即 `PyGeoFetch` 客户端，以及一小组模型来组织。你用 `SearchQuery` 描述请求，调用 "
"`client.search()` 得到一个 `SatelliteData` 影像列表，再把这些影像传给 `client.download()` 或 "
"`client.stream()`。下载行为由 `DownloadOptions` 控制，每次下载都会返回一个记录结果的 "
"`DownloadResult`。处理能力以命名空间的形式暴露在同一个客户端上，例如 "
"`client.indices`、`client.preprocess`、`client.sar` 和 "
"`client.post`，因此对大多数工作流来说，一次导入就足够了。"

#: ../../home/claude/work/docs_audit/docs_out/reference/python-api.md:17
msgid ""
"Because the models are Pydantic classes, they validate their inputs and can "
"be converted to and from dictionaries and JSON, which makes it easy to store"
" a query, log a result or build requests from configuration. The sections "
"below list the fields of each model, the methods of the client and the "
"namespaces it carries."
msgstr ""
"由于这些模型是 Pydantic 类，它们会验证输入，并且可以与字典和 JSON "
"相互转换，这使得存储查询、记录结果或根据配置构建请求都很容易。下面各节列出了每个模型的字段、客户端的方法以及它所携带的命名空间。"

#: ../../home/claude/work/docs_audit/docs_out/reference/python-api.md:19
msgid "Full workflow example"
msgstr "完整工作流示例"

#: ../../home/claude/work/docs_audit/docs_out/reference/python-api.md:65
msgid "`SearchQuery`"
msgstr ""

#: ../../home/claude/work/docs_audit/docs_out/reference/python-api.md:67
msgid ""
"Describes what to search for. Every field is optional. Without an area "
"(`bbox`, `geometry` or `geometry_geojson`), a search is not spatially "
"restricted, which most providers reject or answer with very large result "
"sets."
msgstr ""
"描述要搜索什么。每个字段都是可选的。如果没有区域（`bbox`、`geometry` 或 "
"`geometry_geojson`），搜索就不受空间限制，大多数提供方会拒绝这样的请求，或返回非常庞大的结果集。"

